cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Analysis software for MASLD-Bench. The manuscript author list and
  publication citation are pending author confirmation; this file cites the
  software release only.
title: "MASLD-Bench: corrected cfRNA and eligible-model tissue analysis"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Banerjee
    given-names: Subhadip
version: 2026.11.10-eligible.1
date-released: 2026-11-10
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/subhadipban-lgtm/masld-bench
url: https://subhadipban-lgtm.github.io/masld-bench/
abstract: >-
  MASLD-Bench is a histology-grounded omics-LLM benchmark probing whether
  language models can interpret structured biological evidence for MASLD.
  This release contains the corrected cfRNA analyses and the 17-model
  eligible tissue analysis.
identifiers:
